<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Datum initiated as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Datum initiated as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc said Friday it initiated coverage of Datum Inc, a high-technology company that sells telecommunications products, as a buy.</p>
<p>--It set a 12-month price target of $22 for the stock.</p>
<p>--Rodman estimated Datum could grow from $86 million in trailing 12-month revenues to $130 million in revenues by 1998, or 20 percent compounded over the next two years. Its EPS estimates are $0.41 for 1996, $0.90 for 1997 and $1.30 for 1998.</p>
<p>--Datum was trading at 13-7/8, up 3/4.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
